#: glance/api/versions.py:27 glance/api/glare/versions.py:28
msgid ""
"Public url to use for versions endpoint. The default is None, which will use "
"the request's host_url attribute to populate the URL base. If Glance is "
"operating behind a proxy, you will want to change this to represent the "
"proxy's URL."
msgstr ""
"URL publica d'utilizar pel nosèl final de las versions. La valor per defaut "
"es None : l'atribut host_url de la demanda es emplegat per emplenar la basa "
"de l'URL. Se Glance s'executa darrièr un proxy, vos caldrà cambiar aquesta "
"valor per representar l'URL del proxy."

