msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum de balisas autorizadas sus un imatge. Una valor negativa "
"significa illimitat."

#: glance/common/config.py:79
msgid ""
"Maximum number of locations allowed on an image. Negative values evaluate to "
"unlimited."
msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum d'emplaçaments autorizats sus un imatge. Una valor negativa "
"significa illimitat."

#: glance/common/config.py:82
msgid "Python module path of data access API"
msgstr "API d'accès als donadas del camin del modul Python"

#: glance/common/config.py:84
msgid ""
"Default value for the number of items returned by a request if not specified "
"explicitly in the request"
msgstr ""
"Valor per defaut pel nombre d'elements renviats per una demanda, se aquela "
"es pas explicitament definida dins la demanda"

#: glance/common/config.py:87
msgid ""
"Maximum permissible number of items that could be returned by a request"
msgstr ""
"Nombre d'elements maximum autorizats que pòdon èsser renviats per una demanda"

#: glance/common/config.py:90
msgid ""
"Whether to include the backend image storage location in image properties. "
"Revealing storage location can be a security risk, so use this setting with "
"caution!"
msgstr ""
"Indica se l'emplaçament d'emmagazinatge de l'imatge de rèireplan deu èsser "
"inclús dins las proprietats de l'imatge. Aquò pòt pausar de problèmas de "
"seguretat, doncas, siatz prudent dins l'utilizacion d'aqueste paramètre !"

#: glance/common/config.py:119
msgid ""
"Whether to include the backend image locations in image properties. For "
"example, if using the file system store a URL of \"file:///path/to/image\" "
"will be returned to the user in the 'direct_url' meta-data field. Revealing "
"storage location can be a security risk, so use this setting with caution! "
"Setting this to true overrides the show_image_direct_url option."
msgstr ""
"Indica s'il faut inclure los emplaçaments d'imatge de backend dins las "
"proprietats d'imatge. Per exemple, se utilizatz lo magazin de sistèmas de "
"fichièrs, una URL de tipe \"file:///camin/vers/image\" serà renviada a "
"l'utilizaire dins lo camp de metadonadas  'direct_url'. La revelacion d'un "
"emplaçament d'emmagazinatge pòt presentar una risca de seguretat, donc "
"utilizatz aqueste paramètre amb precaucion ! Definir aqueste paramètre sus "
"true remplaça l'opcion show_image_direct_url."

#: glance/common/config.py:131
msgid ""
"Maximum size of image a user can upload in bytes. Defaults to 1099511627776 "
"bytes (1 TB).WARNING: this value should only be increased after careful "
"consideration and must be set to a value under 8 EB (9223372036854775808)."
msgstr ""
"Talha maximum en octets d'un imatge qu'un utilizaire pòt telecargar. Valor "
"1099511627776 octets (1 To). AVERTIMENT : aquesta valor ne deu èsser "
"augmemptada qu'aprèp un examèn aprigondit e deu èsser definida a una valor "
"inferiora a 8 EB (9223372036854775808)."

#: glance/common/config.py:137
msgid ""
"Set a system wide quota for every user. This value is the total capacity "
"that a user can use across all storage systems. A value of 0 means "
"unlimited.Optional unit can be specified for the value. Accepted units are "
"B, KB, MB, GB and TB representing Bytes, KiloBytes, MegaBytes, GigaBytes and "
"TeraBytes respectively. If no unit is specified then Bytes is assumed. Note "
"that there should not be any space between value and unit and units are case "
"sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Definissètz un quota sistèma sufisent per cada utilizaire. Aquesta valor est "
"la capacitat totala qu'un utilizaire pòt utilizar dins totes los sistèmas "
"d'emmagazinatge.  Una valor nulla significa sens limite. Es possible "
"d'indicar una unitat opcionala per la valor. Las unitats acceptadas son B, "
"KB, MB, GB e TB que representan respectivament d'octets, de quilooctets, de "
"megaoctets, de gigaoctets e de teraoctets. Se cap d'unitat es pas indicada, "
"los octets son utilizats per defaut. La valor e l'unitat devon èsser "
"acoladas e las unitats distinguisson las majusculas e las minusculas."

