#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:36
msgid ""
"The period of time, in seconds, that the API server will wait for a registry "
"request to complete. A value of 0 implies no timeout."
msgstr ""
"Periòde en segondas pendent lo qual lo servidor d'API deu esperar qu'una "
"demanda de registre s'acabe. Una valor de 0 significa pas cap de relambi "
"d'espèra."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:64
msgid ""
"Whether to pass through the user token when making requests to the registry. "
"To prevent failures with token expiration during big files upload, it is "
"recommended to set this parameter to False.If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Transmetre lo geton utilizaire al moment de demandas al registre. Per evitar "
"de fracasses deguts a l'expiracion del geton al moment del telecargament de "
"fichièrs voluminós, es recomandat de definir de paramètre a 'False'.If  Se "
"\"use_user_token\" es pas activat, de donadas d'identificacion administrator "
"devon èsser especificadas."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:73
msgid ""
"The administrators user name. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect, then "
"admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Nom d'utilizaire administrator. Se \"use_user_token\" es pas en vigor, las "
"donadas d'identificacion de l'administrator pòdon èsser especificadas."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:78
msgid ""
"The administrators password. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect, then "
"admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Senhal de l'administrator. Se \"use_user_token\" es pas en vigor, las "
"donadas d'identificacion de l'administrator pòdon èsser especificadas."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:83
msgid ""
"The tenant name of the administrative user. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then admin tenant name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Nom de locatari de l'utilizaire administrator. Se \"use_user_token\" es pas "
"en vigor, lo nom de locatari de l'administrator pòt èsser especificat."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:88
msgid ""
"The URL to the keystone service. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect and "
"using keystone auth, then URL of keystone can be specified."
msgstr ""
"URL del servici keystone. Se \"use_user_token\" es pas en vigor e se "
"utilizatz l'autentificacion keystone, l'URL de keystone pòt pas èsser "
"especificada."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:94
msgid ""
"The strategy to use for authentication. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then auth strategy can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Estrategia a utilizar per l'autentificacion. Se \"use_user_token\" es pas en "
"vigor, l'estrategia d'autentificacion pòt èsser especificada."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:99
msgid ""
"The region for the authentication service. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect and using keystone auth, then region name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"region del servici d'autentificacion. Se \"use_user_token\" es pas en vigor "
"e se utilizatz l'autentificacion keystone, lo nom de region pòt èsser "
"especificat."

#: glance/registry/client/v1/api.py:78 glance/registry/client/v2/api.py:60
msgid "Configuration option was not valid"
msgstr "L'opcion de configuracion èra pas valida"

#: glance/registry/client/v1/api.py:82 glance/registry/client/v2/api.py:64
msgid "Could not find required configuration option"
msgstr "Opcion de configuracion obligatòria introbabla"

